  "extract": "Michael Monroe Lewis is an American author and financial journalist. He has also been a contributing editor to Vanity Fair since 2009, writing mostly on business, finance, and economics. He is known for his nonfiction work, particularly his coverage of financial crises and behavioral finance.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Michael Monroe Lewis</b> is an American author and financial journalist. He has also been a contributing editor to <i>Vanity Fair</i> since 2009, writing mostly on business, finance, and economics. He is known for his nonfiction work, particularly his coverage of financial crises and behavioral finance.</p>"
